<translation id="77997252117517973">Kuzayo maduze</translation>
<translation id="4928968570611226525">Ukuze uqhubeke nalesi senzo kuzodingeka <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_ARC_APP" />&gt;usebenzise uhlelo oluncane lwe-Android<ph name="END_LINK_ARC_APP" /> kudivayisi yakho ye-JemaOS; futhi idivayisi yakho ye-JemaOS idingeka <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_HELP" />ishintshwe iye ku-Developer Mode<ph name="END_LINK_HELP" />.</translation>
<translation id="7395250550107972941">Ayikwazi ukufaka amafayela e-.apk. Sicela uqinisekise ukuthi uhlelo oluncane lwe-Android selusebenza futhi usesimweni se-JemaOS Developer.</translation>
